B.a49=new A.e("What is the most dangerous major complication of cervical spine injections involving particulate steroid injection into an artery?",B.OW,1,"If particulate steroid crystals are injected into a vertebral artery, they act as emboli that clog small vessels, causing spinal cord infarction, stroke, or blindness. This is why the margin for error is non-existent in cervical procedures.")
