B.acF=new A.e("What is the hallmark distinguishing feature of a dural puncture (post-dural puncture) headache?",B.QD,2,"A dural puncture headache is positional: severe when standing (gravity pulls the brain down due to lost CSF cushion, stretching meninges) and relieved when lying flat. This positional nature is the diagnostic key.")
