B.UC=s(["Diabetes causes spinal stenosis","Corticosteroids raise blood sugar and can push poorly controlled diabetics into hyperglycemic crisis, plus high sugar levels increase infection risk","Diabetic patients are allergic to contrast dye","Diabetes causes osteoporosis of the spine"],t.s)
