B.a5J=new A.e("Which of the following is the most important initial intervention to prevent hemiplegic shoulder subluxation?",B.Zw,1,"Proper positioning and arm support (using arm troughs, lap boards, or slings when upright) is the most important initial intervention. Aggressive passive ROM, particularly overhead pulleys, should be avoided as they can worsen impingement and pain.")
