B.a8L=new A.e("Overhead pulleys for hemiplegic shoulder rehabilitation are generally considered:",B.SC,2,"Overhead pulleys are generally contraindicated in hemiplegic shoulders. They can cause impingement, rotator cuff injury, and worsen pain because the patient cannot control the affected arm during the motion.")
