B.a9s=new A.e("According to the ACRM criteria for mild TBI, which of the following is true?",B.V5,2,"The ACRM criteria require at least one of four manifestations: any loss of consciousness, any amnesia before or after the event, any alteration in mental status at the time of injury, or any focal neurologic deficit. Loss of consciousness is not required.")
