B.Y2=s(["A delayed seizure occurring weeks after the first TBI","A catastrophic loss of cerebral vascular autoregulation after a second head injury sustained before recovery from the first, with mortality near 50%","A progressive decline in cognition seen after repeated subconcussive blows over years","A rebound increase in intracranial pressure after premature discontinuation of mannitol"],t.s)
B.acl=new A.e("What is second impact syndrome and why is it so dangerous?",B.Y2,1,"Second impact syndrome occurs when a still-symptomatic patient sustains a second head injury, triggering complete failure of cerebral vascular autoregulation, massive ICP elevation, brain herniation, and mortality close to 50% with near 100% morbidity in survivors.")
