B.a5X=new A.e("Myotonic dystrophy (Steinert disease) is unique among myopathies because it causes:",B.Zd,1,"Myotonic dystrophy is distinctive for causing DISTAL weakness (opposite of most myopathies), plus multisystem effects: hatchet face, frontal balding, ptosis, cataracts, cardiac conduction defects, diabetes, testicular atrophy. EMG shows dive-bomber myotonic discharges.")
