B.abf=new A.e('The "empty can" test primarily evaluates which muscle?',B.XQ,2,"The empty can (Jobe) test: arm at 90\xb0 abduction, 30\xb0 forward flexion, internally rotated (thumb down). Resist downward pressure. Weakness or pain = supraspinatus pathology.")
