B.ac0=new A.e("A motor unit action potential (MUAP) with more than 4 phases is described as:",B.W9,3,"Normal MUAPs have 2-4 phases. MUAPs with >4 phases are polyphasic, indicating remodeling of the motor unit \u2014 either from reinnervation (neuropathic) or fiber splitting/regeneration (myopathic). Up to 15% polyphasic MUAPs can be normal.")
