B.a8x=new A.e("What is the total number of multiple choice questions on part one of the ABPMR board certification exam?",B.Q3,2,"Part one of the ABPMR written exam consists of 325 multiple choice questions split into two sessions (approximately 165 in the morning and 160 in the afternoon) with a 60-minute break between them.")
B.T_=s(["Neurologic disorders and amputation","Musculoskeletal medicine and basic sciences","Neurologic disorders and musculoskeletal medicine","Rehabilitation problems and patient management"],t.s)
B.abV=new A.e("According to the exam content matrix, which two organ system categories together make up approximately 62% of the written board exam?",B.T_,2,"Neurologic disorders account for 30% and musculoskeletal medicine accounts for 32% of the exam, combining for 62% of the total content.")
B.Yr=s(["Five years","Seven years","Ten years","There is no time limit"],t.s)
B.a51=new A.e("What is the maximum number of years after completing residency that a graduate (who finished on or after January 1, 2012) has to pass both parts of the ABPMR board exam?",B.Yr,1,"Graduates who completed training on or after January 1, 2012 have a seven calendar year window from the completion of residency to pass both part one and part two of the board exam.")
