B.a4J=new A.e("What must a program director affirm about a resident before that resident is granted admissibility to sit for part one of the boards?",B.P3,1,"The program director must affirm two things: that the resident completed the required training time, and that the resident has demonstrated sufficient competence to enter practice without direct supervision. This evaluation is due by July 1 of the exam year.")
B.Wo=s(["At any Pearson Professional Center nationwide","At the ABPMR headquarters in Washington DC","Only in Rochester, Minnesota","At the annual AAPMR conference location"],t.s)
B.a7x=new A.e("Where is part two (the oral examination) of the ABPMR board certification exam administered?",B.Wo,2,"Part two, the oral examination, is administered only in Rochester, Minnesota. Candidates must travel there after passing part one and must submit copies of all current, valid, and unrestricted medical licenses.")
