B.a9b=new A.e("In quiet standing, the line of gravity falls in what position relative to the knee joint?",B.MH,1,"The line of gravity falls anterior to the knee in quiet standing, creating an extension moment without constant quad activity.")
B.W7=s(["Flat feet","Training errors (too much, too far, too fast)","Improper shoe selection","Muscle weakness"],t.s)
